1
00:00:00,085 --> 00:00:01,375
(Sheldon:)Speaking of cowboys...

2
00:00:01,544 --> 00:00:05,794
(Sheldon:)...do you know what country
has not one, but two cows on its flag?

3
00:00:05,965 --> 00:00:08,345
(Sheldon:)The tiny landlocked nation of Andorra.

4
00:00:08,510 --> 00:00:11,180
Ooh! The next classic episode
of Sheldon Cooper Presents:

5
00:00:11,346 --> 00:00:13,726
Fun With Flags is writing itseIf.

6
00:00:15,558 --> 00:00:17,898
(Howard:)Oh, let me try the voice recognition.

7
00:00:18,061 --> 00:00:21,481
(Raj:)Hey, I let you peel the plastic,
don't get greedy.

8
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:26,777
- Hello?
WOMAN'S VOICE: Hello.

9
00:00:29,656 --> 00:00:31,406
(Raj:)What's your name?

10
00:00:33,785 --> 00:00:37,375
(Howard:)Look at that. There's finally a woman
in your life you can talk to.

11
00:00:38,498 --> 00:00:40,208
(Raj:)Are you single?

12
00:00:40,375 --> 00:00:44,585
(Siri:)I don't have a marital status,
if that's what you're asking.

13
00:00:44,754 --> 00:00:48,044
(Raj:)Yeah, you're right, that's too personal.
We hardly know each other.

14
00:00:49,843 --> 00:00:51,843
(Raj:)How about a cup of coffee?

15
00:00:52,011 --> 00:00:53,681
I found six coffee shops.

16
00:00:53,847 --> 00:00:57,027
(Siri:)Three of them are fairly close to you.

